-- A checked project's own `Tc` module, sitting where module resolution would
-- find it first. The shadow checker imports `Tc`, so if the shadow ever
-- resolved against the target's search path this file would supply the
-- compiler's own oracle and the project would be choosing the implementation
-- that judges it. It exports none of the names the real checker exports, so
-- that mistake is loud rather than quiet.

type Verdict = Always | Never

fn verdict() : Verdict = Always
